  <diagram id="g1Ap3uMZzJAlJD0p5HbF" name="Page-1">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1341" dy="1041" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;%% Sequence Diagram - Cập nhật trạng thái / Hoàn thành task\n%% State machine guard (Task.CanTransitionTo) + loop báo cho watcher.\n%% Task cha KHÔNG tự động Done khi subtask Done.\nsequenceDiagram\nautonumber\nactor As as Assignee\nparticipant API as TasksController\nparticipant Service as TaskStatusTransitionService\nparticipant Repo as TaskRepository\nparticipant Task as Task (entity)\nparticipant Logger as ActivityLogService\nparticipant Notifier as NotificationService\nparticipant UoW as UnitOfWork\nparticipant DB as Database\nAs-&gt;&gt;API: PATCH /api/v1/tasks/{id}/status (target)\nAPI-&gt;&gt;Service: ChangeStatusAsync(taskId, target, userId)\nService-&gt;&gt;Repo: GetTaskWithLinksAndWatchers(taskId)\nRepo-&gt;&gt;DB: SELECT Task + TaskLinks + Watchers\nDB--&gt;&gt;Repo: Task\nRepo--&gt;&gt;Service: Task\nService-&gt;&gt;Task: CanTransitionTo(target)\nTask--&gt;&gt;Service: bool\nalt invalid (nhay buoc) or bi block chua Done\n  Service--&gt;&gt;API: InvalidTransitionException\n  API--&gt;&gt;As: 409 Conflict\nelse valid\n  Service-&gt;&gt;Task: ChangeStatus(target)\n  Note over Task: chi doi Status cua task nay;&lt;br/&gt;task cha KHONG tu dong Done\n  Service-&gt;&gt;Logger: Write(StatusChanged, task, userId)\n  loop moi Watcher cua task\n    Service-&gt;&gt;Notifier: Notify(watcher, StatusChanged, task)\n  end\n  Service-&gt;&gt;UoW: SaveChangesAsync()\n  UoW-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE Task + INSERT ActivityLog + Notifications\n  DB--&gt;&gt;UoW: ok\n  Service--&gt;&gt;API: TaskDto\n  API--&gt;&gt;As: 200 OK\nend\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="54">
